{
  "email": "admin@example.com",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### Protected - /me without token (should 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me

### Protected - /me with token (should 200)
GET {{baseUrl}}/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
